BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Parenting In Practice
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T150000
UID:2610150z1opYO5zUyJY65L27wn1w
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma Academy will bring together parents and nationally reco
 gnized experts for Parenting in Practice\, a community-wide symposium focu
 sed on the challenges families face while raising children in an increasin
 gly complex and technology-driven world.  \n\nMark your calendars for Sat
 urday\, October 24\, for Parenting in Practice. This special day of keynot
 e speakers\, breakout sessions\, and panel discussions offers something fo
 r those at every stage of the parenting. \n\nParenting in Practice is ope
 n to the broader community\, including parents of younger children and tee
 nagers. Admission is free and includes access to all sessions. \n\nPanel 
 Details Below: \n\nWhat to Consider When Choosing a School\, featuring: 
 Percy L. Abram\, Head of School at Sonoma Academy\; Tracie Mastronicola\, 
 Head of School at The Healdsburg School\; Cecily Stock\, Head of School at
  The Presentation School\; and Brad Weaver\, Head of School at Sonoma Coun
 try Day School.\n\nHow to Succeed in College \\(and Life\\)\, on helping y
 our child to find the intersection between achievement\, fulfillment\, and
  joy featuring Dan Lerner\, NYU Professor and Author of U Thrive.\n\nJason
  Craige Harris\, Educator and CEO of Perception Strategies on teaching kid
 s about agency\, boundaries\, healthy relationships\, and the responsible 
 use of power through healthy relationships and communication.\n\nLori Getz
 \, Internet safety expert and founder of Cyber Education Consultants on ke
 eping kids safe online.\n\nDr. Devorah Heitner\, author of Growing Up in P
 ublic: Coming of Age in a Digital World and Screenwise: Helping Kids Thriv
 e \\(and Survive\\) in Their Digital World on helping your kids manage the
  effects of social media and digital communication.
LOCATION:Sonoma Academy
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/parenting-in-practice/2
 0192748/2026-10-24T09
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
