DESCRIPTION:Knife’s Edge is a uniquely fun opportunity to taste Sonoma F
 amily Meal’s impact while celebrating the power of food to unite us all 
 - across cultures\, kitchens\, and missions! Guests will enjoy globally-in
 spired bites prepared by our talented culinary training alumni\, vote to c
 rown the Culinary Champion\, and sit down to a feast by SFM’s own Cateri
 ng with a Cause\, complete with live music\, local wine & beer\, craft coc
 ktails\, and more—all while helping us raise $240\,000 to expand workfor
 ce development and food security programming at both Petaluma and Unity Ki
 tchens.
LOCATION:SaraLee and Richard's Barn\, Sonoma County Fairgrounds
URL:https://www.sonomafamilymeal.org/knifes-edge-2026
