 al Wellness 4 the Collective!\n\nJoin us to create and take home your own 
 fire cider. Learn how to make this simple yet powerful medicine just in ti
 me for the autumn and winter seasons!\n\nFire cider\, a term coined by Ros
 emary Gladstar\, is a spicy herbal tonic that brings together apple cider 
