DESCRIPTION:Misalliance is one of George Bernard Shaw’s most spirited an
 d surprising comedies. Set in the drawing room of a prosperous English fam
 ily on a seemingly ordinary afternoon\, the tranquility is shattered when 
 an airplane literally crashes into their greenhouse\, introducing a bold\,
  unconventional aviatrix into the midst of polite society. As suitors circ
 le\, secrets surface\, and romantic expectations unravel\, Shaw turns the 
 traditional courtship comedy on its head with sharp wit and deliciously ta
 ngled misunderstandings.
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
