BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NOCHES DE DESPECHADOS — Xitlalic Esparza Live
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T233000
UID:261023on7gCQ6QQU-rICXgnJFdAQ
DESCRIPTION:Xitlalic Esparza en Noches de Despechados: música regional\, 
 rancheras y canciones de desamor. Domingo 8 PM. $10 anticipado. 21+\n\nSom
 e songs are for falling in love. These are for everything that happens aft
 er.\n\nNoches de Despechados comes to Barrel Proof Lounge on Sunday\, Octo
 ber 25\, with Xitlalic Esparza taking the stage for an evening of heartbre
 ak songs\, música regional\, rancheras\, corridos and more.\n\nXitlalic i
 s a local singer with deep roots in the Santa Rosa community. She has perf
 ormed with mariachi\, appeared at local radio and community events\, and e
 ven auditioned for the Spanish-language talent competition Tengo Talento\,
  Mucho Talento . She has also released her own music\, including the singl
 es “Yo te Necesito” and “La Mentada.”\n\nFor Noches de Despechados
  \, she's bringing the songs that hurt a little — the ones about love\, 
 loss\, bad decisions\, broken hearts and getting over the person you proba
 bly shouldn't text tonight. And we're making a full night out of it.\n\nDJ
  JuiceBokz gets things started in The Lounge before the show. 8–10 PM 
 — Xitlalic Esparza LIVE Música Regional • Rancheras • Corridos • 
 Songs of Heartbreak After the show — DJ Caliente takes over the Main Roo
 m and keeps the night moving.\n\nSUNDAY\, OCTOBER 25 Xitlalic Esparza • 
 8–10 PM DJ JuiceBokz • Before the Show DJ Caliente • After the Show 
 $10 Advance • $15 Door 21+\n\nCome sing along to the ones that still sti
 ng. Barrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Ave. Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nCheck ou
 t **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!\n\nNOCH
 ES DE DESPECHADOS — Xitlalic Esparza en Vivo\n\nHay canciones para enamo
 rarse. Y hay canciones para todo lo que viene después.\n\nEste domingo 25
  de octubre llega Noches de Despechados a Barrel Proof Lounge\, con Xitlal
 ic Esparza en vivo para una noche de canciones de desamor\, música region
 al\, rancheras\, corridos y más.\n\nXitlalic es una cantante con raíces 
 en la comunidad de Santa Rosa. Ha cantado con mariachi y participado en pr
 ogramas de radio y eventos de la comunidad. También audicionó para el pr
 ograma Tengo Talento\, Mucho Talento y ha lanzado su propia música\, incl
 uyendo “Yo te Necesito” y “La Mentada.”\n\nEn Noches de Despechado
 s \, Xitlalic trae esas canciones que todavía duelen un poquito — de am
 or\, desamor\, corazones rotos y de esa persona a la que probablemente no 
 deberías mandarle mensaje esta noche.\n\nY vamos a hacer una noche comple
 ta.\n\nDJ JuiceBokz comienza la noche en The Lounge antes del show. 8–10
  PM — Xitlalic Esparza EN VIVO Música Regional • Rancheras • Corrid
 os • Canciones de Desamor Después del show — DJ Caliente toma el Main
  Room para seguir la fiesta.\n\nDOMINGO 25 DE OCTUBRE Xitlalic Esparza •
  8–10 PM DJ JuiceBokz • Antes del Show DJ Caliente • Después del Sh
 ow $10 Anticipado • $15 en la Puerta 21+ Ven a cantar esas canciones que
  todavía duelen.\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Ave. Downtown Santa
  Rosa ¡Visita **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** para descubrir todo lo bueno 
 que viene!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://Despechados.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marin Farmers Markets
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T130000
UID:2610213xmXoemVYU-LDcb6aFQMow
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free Sponsor: Marin Center\n\nExplore the bounty of sum
 mer at the Marin Farmers Markets. Taste vine-ripened tomatoes\, corn that 
 was picked that morning\, and peaches so juicy you have to bend over just 
 to get a bite. Farm-fresh eggs\, grass-fed beef\, artisan c heeses\, raw m
 ilk\, and freshly baked breads complete the shopping exper ience. Specialt
 y prepared foods and handmade art add to the magic of the market. Enjoy th
 e intimate feeling of the Thursday Marin Farmers Market\, an ideal place t
 o meet for lunch and pick up fresh produce for the weekend. Discover the a
 bundance and diversity of product at the celebrated Sunday Marin Farmers M
 arket\, the third largest farmers market in California. Turn your dollar i
 nto a vote for local sustainable agriculture\, shrink your eco-footprint\,
  and revive the feeling of being intimate ly connected to your food by mee
 ting your farmers face-to-face. The market takes place rain or shine.  www
 .aginstitutemarin.org
LOCATION:Marin County Civic Center
URL:https://www.marincounty.org/main/calendar#/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Poet Jeremy Raikes’s book signing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T180000
UID:2610213BG-i5yjsU6d7Jm85Dxf-g
DESCRIPTION:Poet Jeremy Raikes (well known to many in Sonoma County as the
  Chair Repair Guy!) will celebrate his 90th birthday and the publication o
 f his poetry collection\, *Delicious Suspicions*\, with a book signing an
 d birthday gathering on Sunday\, October 25\, 2026\, at 4:00 p.m. at Wonde
 rland Pizzeria\, 20391 Highway 116 in Monte Rio.\n\nRaised on a cattle ran
 ch in Argentina by expat British parents\, in the 1960's Jeremy was an adv
 ertising writer at J Walter Thompson (then the largest advertising agency 
 in the world) and later became creative director of their Mexico City offi
 ce. While at Thompson\, Jeremy collaborated with Charles Schultz on a seri
 es of animated Peanuts ads for the Ford Motor Company.\n\nThe occasion off
 ers readers a chance to meet Jeremy\, purchase a signed copy of his book a
 nd celebrate a writer whose work approaches life with humor\, tenderness a
 nd an enduring sense of wonder.\n\n*Delicious Suspicions* explores love\,
  friendship\, loss\, aging and the pleasures of everyday encounters. Playf
 ul wordplay and conversational rhythms sit alongside candid reflections on
  sorrow\, spiritual faith and human connection. These are poems that ackno
 wledge life’s difficulties while returning\, again and again\, to affect
 ion\, gratitude and delight.\n\nOne poem’s title\, “I’M NOT AS OLD A
 S I USED TO BE\,” offers a fitting introduction to a poet celebrating hi
 s 90th birthday with a new book. Elsewhere\, a trip to the laundromat beco
 mes an unexpected encounter with love\, and a walk along the beach becomes
  a celebration of companionship.\n\nThe gathering combines a literary occa
 sion with a personal milestone: an opportunity to discover Raikes’s poet
 ry and wish its author a happy 90th birthday.
LOCATION:Wonderland Pizzeria
URL:https://wonderlandpizzeria.toast.site/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Healing Hearts -  A Healing Sip & Paint Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T153000
UID:2610203eRRmhFoWkCPYU4l2nwgiQ
DESCRIPTION:Healing Hearts by JassverArt is more than a paint class - it's
  a creative experience designed to help you relax\, reconnect\, and create
  from the heart. Begin with a gentle guided meditation\, then paint your o
 wn beautiful wooden heart with step-by-step instruction. No experience is 
 necessary - just bring an open heart. Gather with friends\, enjoy the beau
 tiful atmosphere at Vino Godfather Winery\, and leave with a one-of-a-kind
  piece of art and a peaceful heart.\n\nWhile painting\, enjoy music by Key
  Lime Pie performing 1-4pm. \\*Music included with Sip & Paint admission.\
 n\nYour first glass of wine\, of your choice\, is included with admission.
  All art supplies will be provided. Bring your own protective covering if 
 you'd like. Charcuterie items and other snacks will be available for purch
 ase\, along with additional wine by the glass or bottle. There will be a s
 hort break to replenish drinks and grab snacks.\n\nFood: Delicious Dishez 
 will be serving up Cajun Cuisine: southern fried chicken\, fried fish\, sh
 rimp\, fresh hand cut chicken tenders\, sticky icky wings\, gourmet Mac n 
 cheese\, collard greens\, seasoned fries\, and hush puppies!\n\nSpace is l
 imited to 20 guests. Class will take place in backyard venue\, dress accor
 dingly\, evenings can be cool.
