BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Full Moon Paddle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T193000
UID:260306udLddnYNpEmGoI9XLQ0c-g
DESCRIPTION:Come play on the river at night.\n\nJoin The Floathouse for a 
 magical evening paddle on the Petaluma River—Petaluma’s Longest Park
 —timed to catch the full moon rising over the wetlands just south of dow
 ntown. As twilight fades\, we’ll head out together in Hobie pedal kayaks
  for a relaxed\, guided glide that turns nighttime into playtime.\n\nThese
  pedal-powered kayaks make the journey smooth and easy\, even if there’s
  a breeze or moving tide. We’ll cruise about a mile and a half downriver
  to the perfect moonrise vantage point\, where calm water\, wide skies\, a
 nd glowing reflections set the scene.\n\nThis is a social\, feel-good outd
 oor experience designed for anyone looking for something a little differen
 t to do after dark—part nature\, part adventure\, part pure vibe.\n\n$60
  per person includes everything: • Hobie pedal kayak • PFD and safety 
 lights • Experienced local guide • A memorable\, moonlit river experie
 nce\n\n✨ Easy. Playful. Peaceful. Spend your evening under the full moon
 —on the water.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/petaluma-river-full-moo
 n-paddle/17974383/2026-10-25T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T170000
UID:2604309oJCFSNinkKMSNGaZ6Tiyw
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
