 nd authentic sharing. There is no right way to participate—you're invite
 d to share as much or as little as feels comfortable.\n\nBring a journal\,
  an open heart\, and curiosity for the journey ahead. I look forward to ga
 thering with you and creating a meaningful experience together.\n\nBegins 
