BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Are All Going To Die: End-of-Life Option Act
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T143000
UID:261023nCkp2slDbE2riQTiSd6Ipg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Part 3 of our three-part Death and Dying series. L
 earn about the End-of-Life Option Act with Dennis Pocekay M.D. and co-host
 ed by the Village Network of Petaluma The California End of Life Option Ac
 t allows a terminally ill California resident to request a drug from a phy
 sician that will end the patient's life. People who follow the steps of th
 e law will not be considered to have committed suicide\, and physicians wh
 o prescribe the aid-in-dying drug will not be subject to legal liability o
 r professional sanction. This presentation will review the eligibility\, p
 rocedure\, and documentation requirements of the law.
LOCATION:Petaluma Library
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/we-are-all-going-die-end-life-d
 oulas-and-holistic-support-dying-linda-suhrend-life-doula-0
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
