UID:261020bybGQaHnaUSgLXhSbsJfPg
DESCRIPTION:A recovered signal. A sealed facility. One night of clearance.
 \n\n**Enter Area 51: The Mercy Incident**\, an immersive Halloween experie
 nce where a classified alien experiment has gone very\, very wrong.\n\nA r
 ecovered spacecraft. Extraterrestrial research. A mysterious lab leak. And
  a containment protocol that may not hold until the end of the night.\n\nR
 eport to the perimeter checkpoint. Present your identification. Receive yo
 ur clearance. Then enter the facility and discover what happened inside.\n
 \n**CLASSIFIED ACCESS GRANTED FOR ONE NIGHT ONLY.**\n\n🛸 Immersive Area
  51 experience\n\n👽 Live encounters & unexpected discoveries\n\n📸 Ci
 nematic photo moments\n\n🎶 Live music\n\n🌿 Cannabis tastings\, brand
  activations\, and goodie bags\n\n🎃 Costume contest\n\n**FACILITY EFFEC
 TS**\n\nThis immersive event may include fog/haze\, flashing lights\, loud
  audio\, and confined scenic environments.\n\n21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420
 -LIC\n\n**EVENT TERMS & CONDITIONS**\n\nThis event is 21+ only. Valid gove
 rnment-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at the Mer
 cy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video recording 
 may take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for marke
 ting and promotional purposes across various channels\, without compensati
 on. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event details\, ti
 ming\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption is li
 mited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable local and st
 ate regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, yo
 u agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://mercywellness.com/area51halloweenparty
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
