BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:21+ Halloween Bash
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T020000
UID:260930L74_9Z_NAkKzRbCpoL6QPg
DESCRIPTION:Date: Friday October 30th\n\nTime: 10:00pm-2:00am\n\nDoors Ope
 n at 9:00pm\n\nNo Entry After 11:30pm\n\nAges 21\\+. Valid IDs Required Up
 on Entry.\n\nGet ready for the ultimate Halloween experience at Poppy Bank
  Epicenter's fifth annual 21\\+ Halloween Bash!\n\nWe're shutting down ear
 ly to throw the biggest Halloween party in Northern California\, and you w
 on't want to miss it.\n\nDoors open at 9:00pm at the Chuck's/Victory House
  entrance. Due to the sheer size of the event\, we recommend that you arri
 ve early so you can get the party started as soon as possible!\n\nThis ele
 ctrifying night features three dance floors and three DJs mixing different
  kinds of music.\n\nThe main dance floor inside Red Eye Barbecue will be p
 umping out everyone's favorite top hits\, mixed by DJ Sykwidit. With a ful
 l bar boasting 24 taps\, you'll be two-stepping with a drink in hand all n
 ight.\n\nDJ Famous Amos will be spinning the hottest Latin tracks inside o
 f Chuck's Bowling. Hit the Chuck's dance floor and enjoy convenient drink 
 access from Chuck's full bar. Grab a bowling lane with your crew and have 
 some fun!\n\nBOWLING SPECIAL | 5 Frame Bowling for $5/person \\(shoes are 
 included\\)\n\nSwitch it up and check out DJ Willie inside of Game-On Arca
 de\, where he'll be spinning Latin House Music all night long. DJ Willie i
 s known to keep the energy on the dance floor high with his Latin beats. W
 ith over 100 arcade games\, including Laser Tag and the XD Dark Ride\, the
 re will be plenty of activities to keep you entertained!\n\nThis is a cost
 ume party and we encourage everyone to dress to impress—who knows\, you 
 might even get a surprise gift from one of our staff if your costume stand
 s out! No weapons of any kind \\(including props\\) or full face coverings
  are allowed for safety reasons.\n\nWith three DJs\, multiple bars\, bowli
 ng\, arcade games\, costumes and more\, this is the Halloween party of the
  year. Get ready to turn up with 700\\+ fellow Halloween party-goers at ou
 r sixth annual 21\\+ Halloween Bash!\n\nTICKET INFORMATION\n\nPresale: $25
 \n\n• Entry into the event\n\nPresale \\+ Arcade Special: $65\n\n• Ent
 ry into the event\n\n• 225 Chip Arcade Game Card\n\n• One round of Las
 er Tag\n\n• One round of XD Dark Ride\n\nIMPORTANT EVENT POLICIES:\n\n\\
 *Valid ID's Required In order to consume alcoholic beverages\, you must es
 tablish that you are at least 21 years of age.\n\nWe accept the following 
 Identification for the purchase of alcohol per Alcohol Beverage Control st
 andards: - State issued driver license. - State Issued Identification card
 . - Passport or passport card. - Military ID.\n\nLegally acceptable identi
 fication is one card that contains these six characteristics: - Issued by 
 a U.S. government agency \\(federal\, state\, county\, or city\\) - Name o
 f the person - Date of birth - Photograph - Physical description \\(height
 \, weight\, hair\, and eye color\\) - Currently valid \\(not expired\\)\n\
 nWe do not accept the following forms of identification for the purchase o
 f alcohol: - Foreign driver license/identification card - U.S. Government 
 Immigrant identification card - Birth Certificate - School or work identif
 ication card - Identification issued by a non-government agency - Social S
 ecurity card - Interim or temporary driver license or receipt for license 
 from DMV - Check cashing card - Otherwise valid document that in our discr
 etion is expired\, damaged\, altered\, borrowed\, stolen\, counterfeit\, o
 r forged\n\n\\*No bags allowed. Small handbags are allowed but are subject
 ed to search.\n\n\\*No smoking on the premises\, including vaporizers and 
 electronic cigarettes.\n\n\\*No loitering. Loitering on theses premises or
  in the adjacent parking areas is strictly prohibited. If you are caught d
 rinking in the parking lot you will be asked to leave the premises.\n\n\\*
 No in-and-outs. Once you leave the event you may not re-enter. This preven
 ts unwanted activity from happening in our parking lots.\n\n\\*No outside 
 food and beverage is allowed inside of Poppy Bank Epicenter.\n\nPoppy Bank
  Epicenter\n\n3215 Coffey Ln\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95403\n\ninfo@visitepicen
 ter.com
LOCATION:Poppy Bank Epicenter
URL:https://www.sevenrooms.com/events/victoryhouse/evnnt
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
