SUMMARY:A Haunted Victorian Halloween at Songbird Parlour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T223000
UID:261009qyJ0o6bdYku2LfUsuKvt8g
DESCRIPTION:Step into the shadows of Songbird Parlour's historic 1839 mano
 r for  A Haunted Victorian Halloween\, an elegant evening where Gothic atm
 osphere meets modern Halloween revelry. Guests are encouraged to dress in 
 their finest vintage-inspired costumes\, from mysterious fortune tellers a
 nd ethereal ghosts to vampires and sorceresses. The Modern Victorian parlo
 ur will be transformed with candlelight\, shadows\, and haunting décor fo
 r an atmospheric celebration. Dance the night away to music from a local D
 J while enjoying passed hors d'oeuvres and spooky low-ABV cocktails\, beer
 \, wine\, and mocktails. Guests can also compete for the $250 cash prize i
 n the costume contest.This adults-only Halloween celebration offers an unf
 orgettable night of music\, costumes\, food\, and festive fun in Sonoma Va
 lley. Costumes are encouraged\, and the event is for guests 21 and over.
LOCATION:Songbird Parlour
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/a-haunted-victorian-halloween-at-songbird
 -parlour-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
