DESCRIPTION:May – October. Fridays from 7:30 am – 12:00 pm. Located in
  Crane Park in downtown St. Helena. The St. Helena Farmers’ Market is a 
 California Certified Farmers’ Market committed to supporting our local f
 armers and providing a place for the community to find\, connect and learn
  about the finest farm-fresh and sustainably grown produce\, specialty foo
 ds and artisan goods available direct from the source. The St. Helena Farm
 ers’ Market provides our community with a beautiful venue for meeting fr
 iends\, greeting neighbors and enjoying a delightful musical interlude eve
 ry Friday morning. Enjoy fresh produce\, gourmet food vendors\, beautiful 
 hand crafted items and non-profit organizations in this family friendly at
 mosphere with Kids’ Programs\, a large Kid’s Playground and shaded Ind
 ividual and Group Picnic Areas under the Redwood Trees. Whether you are sh
 opping\, enjoying a coffee and pastry or watching a chef prepare a seasona
 lly inspired dish\, we welcome you to join us.
