DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T170000
UID:260921Z1y5uNLQKEStm0-JGVs4eA
DESCRIPTION:**On Saturday October 3\,** **Gallery Route One** in Point R
 eyes Station opens three news exhibitions: Bruce Mitchell’s *Gravitati
 onal Pull\,* fine-art wood sculpture\; Steven Hurwitz’s abstract multime
 dia wall constructions\; and Geoffrey Campen’s *Offcut*\, mixed-media w
 ork based on architectural plans\; The public is cordially invited to the
  opening\, October 3\, 3 to 5pm. Meet GRO Artists\, see the show\, and en
 joy a glass of wine. Shows run until November 8\, open 11am to 5pm\, Thurs
  through Mon. https://galleryrouteone.org
LOCATION:Gallery Route One
URL:https://galleryrouteone.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
