UID:261023lSM60lSZWUmaItA9mYnlrw
DESCRIPTION:The Vallejo JFK Library offers the Lawyers in the Library prog
 ramon the first and third Wednesdays of every month. Each meeting is 15 mi
 nutes. Space is limited and slots fill up on a first come\, first serve ba
 sis. Please callor come in-person to Vallejo JFK Library at 9am on the day
  of the program to reserve a spot. Currently\, our program offers phone co
 nsultations with a lawyer. If you have an appointment\, the attorney will 
 call you that evening between 5:30 - 7:15pm. PLEASE NOTE: In-person meetin
 gs are not currently offered. Coming to the library during the scheduled a
 ppointment window will not result in an in-person meeting. You will need a
  working phone to receive the call. The library is unable to provide telep
 hone access for a lawyer consultation. If you would like more information\
 , please call us at \\(866\\) 572-7587.
LOCATION:Vallejo John F. Kennedy Library
URL:https://solanolibrary.libnet.info/event/15399273
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Curious Kids
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T153000
UID:261023QJJAQypDFUGqmfK38AfExA
DESCRIPTION:In eachsession we'll enjoy a longer picture book and then expl
 ore it further through an art project or science activity. This is a pilot
  program for kids ages 6 - 10\; if there's enough interest we'll continue 
 it beyond these three events. September 2 "No Monkeys\, No Chocolate" by M
 elissa Stewart and Allen Young. What exactly do monkeys have to do with ch
 ocolate? Find out\, plus taste test chocolate & investigate its properties
 . October 7 "I Was: The Stories of Animal Skulls" by Katherine Hawker & Na
 tasha Donovan. Investigate owls and dissect a pellet. November 4 "The Spac
 esuit: How a Seamstress Helped Put Man on the Moon" by Alison Donald and A
 riel Landy. Sew a small planet or spacecraft.
LOCATION:Fairfield Cordelia Library
URL:https://solanolibrary.libnet.info/event/16858614
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
