UID:261023KGsedymnR0qYJY63k35JZQ
DESCRIPTION:Phenomenal new live band and beguiling new album\n\nSteve Bart
 on has formed a phenomenal new live band comprising: **Steve Barton** (gui
 tar\, lead vocals)\, **Dave Scheff** (drums)\, **Gina Graziano** (rhythm g
 uitar\, harmony vocals)\, **Janene Mitchell** (keyboard\, harmony vocals)\
 , and **Victor Krummenacher** (bass). Dave Scheff is from Translator. Gina
  Graziano was leader of the bands Silver Threads\, and Novellas. Janene Mi
 tchell comes from a classical music background and has worked with Steve b
 efore. Victor Krummenacher was in Camper Van Beethoven and Cracker.\n\nSte
 ve's forthcoming album — the beguiling ***See-Saw Hullabaloo*** — feat
 ures special guests including **Dave Scheff** (Translator)\, **Scott McCau
 ghey** (REM)\, and **Debbi Peterson** (The Bangles). The new album was mix
 ed by **Scott McCaughey.** And also features a co-write with Steve's frien
 d **Casey Neill.** The album is due to be released on 23rd October 2026. S
 teve's new band will play an Album Launch Show at Alberta Street Pub\, Por
 tland\, Oregon on October 25th 2026\; plus shows in Forestville November 5
  and SF Make Out Room Nov 6
LOCATION:Forestville Club
URL:http://forestvilleclub.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
