UID:260722CXYp_6EgX0CBeggkp1JPyA
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Highway 12 Band & Brunch Boys**\n\nJoin us for a lively Friday ni
 ght at Longboard Vineyards in our **Barrel Room**\, located in **downtown 
 Healdsburg**\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold street
 -style food. Our **Music\, Wine & Dine Night** pairs the high-energy\, cro
 wd-pleasing sounds of **Highway 12 Band** with the flavorful dishes of **B
 runch Boys.**\n\nHighway 12 Band brings a fun mix of danceable hits and fa
 miliar favorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and socia
 l evening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard
 ’s wines by the glass or bottle while Brunch Boys serve the best smash b
 urgers and fries around!\n\n**Friday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM** **Free entry*
