UID:261011HEaNYJQOA0OgSjpYMAvPYg
DESCRIPTION:Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?\n\nAre you a 
 salsa dancer who has the basics down but is ready to add more? Our Interme
 diate Salsa Class is designed to help you transform your dancing moves.\n\
 nIn this class\, you’ll go beyond the basics to learn intricate footwork
 \, enhance your leading and following skills\, and master the body movemen
 t that will make you shine on the dance floor.\n\nThis class is for anyone
  ready to learn the techniques and intermediate steps needed to take their
  dancing to the next level.\n\nYou’ll learn intermediate dancing techniq
 ues that will help you:\n\n• Express yourself with sharper footwork and 
 styling.\n\n• Master complex turn patterns and combinations.\n\n• Stre
 ngthen your lead and follow for seamless\, connected dancing.\n\n• Adapt
  to different partners and music with ease on the social dance floor.\n\nW
 hat to Expect: Instructor blends a fun\, supportive atmosphere with struct
 ured lessons\, so you’re always challenged but never overwhelmed. Helpin
 g you progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n
 \nDetails:\n\n• No partner necessary—rotations ensure everyone dances.
 \n\n• Please wear non-marking shoes to protect the floor.\n\n• Arrive 
 10 minutes early to warm up and get settled.\n\n• When: Fridays\, 6:30 P
 M – 7:30 PM\n\nInstructor: Eric Celestino\n\nWhere: 4140 Redwood Highway
  \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/intermediate-salsa-with-eric/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T170000
UID:261004Lwk6VuHdY0uOVRSnrZf8Vg
DESCRIPTION:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design\n\nCr
 eated in collaboration with the Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.\n\n
 EAMES & EAMES explores the iterative\, hands-on\, and human-centered appr
 oach of Charles & Ray Eames. Through furniture\, toys\, paintings\, graphi
 cs\, and personal belongings collected over their lifetimes\, this groundb
 reaking exhibition looks beyond the iconic Eames chairs to reveal the brea
 dth of their creative practice. More than any single object\, their work o
 pened doors to new and unexpected ways of seeing\, thinking\, making\, and
  understanding the world—ideas that continue to inspire us today.\n\nCur
 ated by Llisa Demetrios\, Co-Founder & The Lucia Eames Chief Curator of th
 e Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.
LOCATION:The MAC - Napa Valley Museum of Art & Culture
URL:https://napavalleymuseum.org/blogs/upcoming-exhibitions/eames-eames
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
