UID:261002lhDaGkbH6EyYD0jsh8qD1Q
DESCRIPTION:Speed Networking is a structured\, high-energy networking form
 at designed to create meaningful one-on-one connections in a short amount 
 of time. Unlike traditional mixers\, participants rotate through a series 
 of guided conversations\, making the experience approachable for both intr
 overts and extroverts while maximizing the value of every minute. The goal
  is simple: every attendee leaves having made at least one connection they
  genuinely want to continue. This program is developed in collaboration wi
 th community partners and hosted at the Redwood Credit Union Community Roo
 m\, providing a welcoming and accessible setting aligned with RCU’s comm
 itment to community engagement. Admission No cost for members\; $50 for no
 n-members\; limited to 50 participants
LOCATION:Redwood Credit Union Cleveland Ave Branch (3033 Cleveland Ave\, C
 A)
