DESCRIPTION:Bay Area Cinema\, a free pop-up microcinema showcasing short f
 ilms\, is a family friendly event. Our 8th show will feature films from a 
 variety of genres (animation\, documentary\, music videos\, narrative\, an
 d experimental) which explore themes and subjects such as environmental\, 
 human interest\, and BIPOC/ethnic. \n\nWe had a little over 200 short fil
 ms from around the country and locally submitted for Bay Area Cinema #8. W
 e are proud to announce that we have selected 13 filmmakers and we would l
 ike to share their amazing films at our next screening\, (during the Valle
 jo Art Walk) at The Exchange\, 617 Marin Street\, on Friday\, November 13t
 h\, 2026\, doors open at 6:30pm\, showtime is 7pm-9:30pm. Like always\, fi
 lmmakers will be there for a Q&A with the audience immediately following t
 he screening. Mark your calendars\, this will be a great show! This is a f
 ree event with $10 suggested donation.
LOCATION:The Exchange 
