UID:261022LUnVot0p7Ee5ISuLrxQwhA
DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Saturday\, November 14\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6
  PM | Show 7 PM\n\n**Tickets:** $10 | Free for Coyote Sonoma Club Members
 \n\nGlory Dayz celebrates the best of the best classic rock-n-roll music f
 rom the 60's through the 2000's. With front man Frankie Adel - former lead
  singer from Sha Na Na - bringing his dynamic stage presence\, this band w
 ill keep you dancing all night long. Our collective experience includes wo
 rking with some of music's greats such as: Celine Dion\, Hall & Oates\, Hu
 ey Lewis\, Beach Boys\, Paul Anka\, Kenny Rogers and more. Our goal is to 
 ignite music memories from your own Glory Days. We fill the house with goo
 d vibes\, good crowds and rockin-good times!
