DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T220000
UID:261021obE8eHrJGkaH2ap88xn6Gg
DESCRIPTION:The North Bay Jewelry Arts Guild invites visitors to its 3rd a
 nnual ADORN Holiday Jewelry Market show and sale at Chimera Art Space\, 67
 92 Sebastopol Avenue\, Sebastopol\, CA \\(across from The Barlow\\). The e
 vent\, November 14 & 15\, features unique\, handcrafted wearable art - per
 fect for gift giving as well as personal collections. Each piece highlight
 s the creativity and skill of our local artisans as they offer this curate
 d selection of jewelry. The North Bay Jewelry Arts Guild is dedicated to s
 upporting and promoting the art of jewelry making in the North Bay region.
LOCATION:Chimera Art Space
URL:http://chimeraarts.org 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
