 e're gathering at Laguna Lab in Sebastopol to relive and release this year
 's Burn. Inside\, live bands play through the afternoon and DJs take over 
 as the sun goes down. Outside\, theme camps share their gifts\, artists sh
 ow us what they've got\, and art cars strut their stuff. There will be fir
 e\, but no Burn.\n\nIt's the first North Bay Decom since 2011\, and it's f
 or everyone: Burners\, first-timers\, families and the Burner-curious. Com
 e as you are\, in your finest playa wear\, and bring warm layers for the e
 vening.
