DESCRIPTION:The North Bay Jewelry Arts Guild invites visitors to its 3rd a
 nnual ADORN Holiday Jewelry Market show and sale at Chimera Art Space\, 67
 92 Sebastopol Avenue\, Sebastopol\, CA \\(across from The Barlow\\). The e
 vent\, November 14 & 15\, features unique\, handcrafted wearable art - per
