UID:261012ho5aMKDNE06GWbk4WaTenw
DESCRIPTION:Join Winery Sixteen 600 on Thursday\, November 19 for **Beats
 \, Burgers\, & Blends:** A **Phil Coturri Appreciation Day and Nouveau R
 elease Party.**  \n\nIn honor of the City of Sonoma’s official holiday\
 , Phil Coturri Day\, we’ll be celebrating the only way we know how: wi
 th our friends\, listening to music\, drinking wine\, and having fun.  \
 n\nMusic is by Lionize. Food will be available for purchase from Eugene’
 s Burgers.  \n\nTickets are $20. All tickets include a complimentary tas
 te of our 2026 Nouveau.  \n\nThe party will take place at Sixteen 600’
 s Tasting House\, located at 589 First Street West in Sonoma\, CA.  \n
 \nThursday\, November 19\, 2026. 5PM to 9PM.  \n\nQuestions? Give us a 
 call\, text\, or email. We can't wait to see you all there!
